{"discussions":[{"id":"888dbaa0-9ef2-11f1-8080-800134a7c08b","post":{"id":"888dbaa0-9ef2-11f1-8080-800134a7c08b","owner":{"id":"46003346","username":"BigNonTech","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/45917926/1.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/45917926/1.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/45917926/1.jpg"},"roles":["eTorian","CopyPortfolio","Verified","Regular"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":54,"piLevel":0},"obsoleteId":"785774d5-6d9a-49f6-b061-7b063dfa147e","created":"2026-08-23T12:59:53.546Z","message":{"text":"🥤 Coca-Cola Targets the Next Generation of Customised Drinks\n\n👉 $KO is expanding its innovation efforts beyond traditional soft drinks, developing equipment for “dirty sodas,” refreshers and other customisable beverages.\n\n👉 The company is adapting its Freestyle dispensers to meet growing demand for more personalised, visually appealing drinks — particularly among younger consumers.\n\n👉 Customised drinks are becoming an increasingly important traffic and margin driver for restaurants, as consumers continue to spend selectively on affordable treats.\n\n👉 Coca-Cola is also testing refreshers, iced-coffee solutions and white-label beverage concepts with food-service partners.\n\n👉 While sparkling drinks remain Coca-Cola’s largest category, the company is looking to capture faster-growing occasions in energy, coffee and functional beverages.\n\n💡 One interesting takeaway:\nCoca-Cola’s opportunity is not only selling more drinks — it is helping restaurants create higher-margin beverage occasions. Innovation in dispensing equipment gives the company valuable consumer data while helping its partners respond faster to changing tastes.\n\n\n🔎 Read more: https://www.forbes.com/sites/conormurray/2026/08/19/gold-price-hits-two-month-high-after-mostly-stagnant-summer/ \n\n\n✨ $KO is part of eToro’s @BigNonTech Smart Portfolio, which provides diversified exposure to the world’s largest publicly listed companies across major non-technology sectors.\n\nThe portfolio is available with a minimum investment of $500 and includes holdings such as $WMT, $JPM, $BAC, $CVX.US, $LLY, $MA and $UNH .\n\nYour capital is at risk. Past performance is not an indication of future results.","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-08-23T13:00:09.997Z","isDeleted":false,"type":"Default","metadata":{},"attachments":[{"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/bignontech/8c99db74-6df6-4faa-b96d-b5e945cce433-2026-08-23.png","host":"openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com","mediaType":"Image","media":{"image":{"width":1200,"height":628,"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/bignontech/8c99db74-6df6-4faa-b96d-b5e945cce433-2026-08-23.png"},"video":{"videoSource":"None","image":{"width":0,"height":0}}}}],"tags":[{"market":{"id":"1024","symbolName":"KO","displayName":"Coca-Cola","updated":"2026-09-01T08:15:55.386Z","assetType":"Stocks","internalId":1024,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/ko/50x50.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/ko/90x90.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/ko/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/1024/1024_F40009_F7F7F7.svg","backgroundColor":"#F40009","textColor":"#F7F7F7"}},"application":"eToro","metadata":"","assetTypeId":5,"assetTypeSubCategoryId":0}},{"market":{"id":"1035","symbolName":"WMT","displayName":"Walmart Inc.","updated":"2026-09-01T08:15:55.382Z","assetType":"Stocks","internalId":1035,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/wmt/50x50.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/wmt/90x90.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/wmt/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/1035/1035_1975CE_F7F7F7.svg","backgroundColor"